The technique for embedding a layered child window in the Windows 11
taskbar (src/win/taskbar.rs: embed; src/win/layered.rs: present) follows
CodeZeno/Claude-Code-Usage-Monitor, https://github.com/CodeZeno/Claude-Code-Usage-Monitor
(src/native_interop.rs embed_as_child and src/window/positioning.rs
render_custom_window). No code was copied verbatim; the approach and its
Windows 11 caveats were carried over. Its licence:

